         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "86742626-d3d6-4a8b-9c99-f356b6c65401",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "d862242c-0538-4b18-8b32-4a84d4a5858e",
               "text": "History Tracers Team",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=d862242c-0538-4b18-8b32-4a84d4a5858e",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "8bbd4fa3-d3cf-4ff4-bd96-65dc852e508b",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=8bbd4fa3-d3cf-4ff4-bd96-65dc852e508b",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Como Você\n\nO número três também é o número de arestas — lados — que um triângulo tem.\n\nObserve os triângulos abaixo: todos têm o mesmo tamanho, e cada um tem três lados iguais. Por causa disso, podemos contar os lados de triângulos diferentes de 3 em 3.\n\nConte todos os lados juntos: 3, 6, 9! Então 3 + 3 + 3 = 9, o que significa 3 × 3 = 9.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 440 180\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three equilateral triangles of the same size\"><g fill=\"#e8f5e9\" stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"20,160 120,160 70,73.4\"/><polygon points=\"170,160 270,160 220,73.4\"/><polygon points=\"320,160 420,160 370,73.4\"/></g><g stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"70.0\" y1=\"156.0\" x2=\"70.0\" y2=\"164.0\"/><line x1=\"91.5\" y1=\"118.7\" x2=\"98.5\" y2=\"114.7\"/><line x1=\"48.5\" y1=\"118.7\" x2=\"41.5\" y2=\"114.7\"/><line x1=\"220.0\" y1=\"156.0\" x2=\"220.0\" y2=\"164.0\"/><line x1=\"241.5\" y1=\"118.7\" x2=\"248.5\" y2=\"114.7\"/><line x1=\"198.5\" y1=\"118.7\" x2=\"191.5\" y2=\"114.7\"/><line x1=\"370.0\" y1=\"156.0\" x2=\"370.0\" y2=\"164.0\"/><line x1=\"391.5\" y1=\"118.7\" x2=\"398.5\" y2=\"114.7\"/><line x1=\"348.5\" y1=\"118.7\" x2=\"341.5\" y2=\"114.7\"/></g></svg>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "Três triângulos do mesmo tamanho, cada um com três lados iguais.",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "020f82a9-dede-4717-bacd-c4b309a17c85",
